     2525                 find first buf_ext-classif no-lock where
     2526                           buf_ext-classif.classif-subject = 'gds-grp':U
     2527                       and buf_ext-classif.classif-name = 'rpm_gds-grp':U
     2528                       and buf_ext-classif.db-num = - 1
     2529                       and buf_ext-classif.key#_one    = temp_grp-line.depart-code
     2530                       and buf_ext-classif.key#_two    = temp_grp-line.class-code
     2531                       and buf_ext-classif.key#_three  = temp_grp-line.subclass-code no-error.
     2532                 if available buf_ext-classif then do:
     2533                   RUN gen-row-keyr IN THIS-PROCEDURE ( INPUT buf_ext-classif.uniq-key-rec
     2534                                                       ,INPUT ?
